//! Machine-extracted mMck key tables (a-z syllable/bigram pairs).
//!
//! Extracted verbatim from src/game/m_mail_check_ovl.c (GAFE01_00 Rev. 0).
//! Retail USA bug note: these tables end with `0, 0` (or nothing) in the
//! retail build while `mMck_cmp_key` scans for a 0x7F terminator, so the
//! retail loop reads past the table into neighboring static data. That
//! out-of-bounds behavior depends on the retail linker layout and cannot
//! be reproduced from source; the Rust search stops at the table end
//! (documented deviation, see `cmp_key`).

